### Login
POST http://localhost:3001/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "YOUR_REGISTERED_PATIENT_EMAIL",
  "password": "YOUR_REGISTERED_PASSWORD"
}

### Register a test patient
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Patient",
  "email": "medcore.test@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!"
}


### 1. Register a hospital
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
POST {{baseUrl}}/hospitals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "MedCore General Hospital",
  "slug": "medcore-general-hospital",
  "email": "admin@medcorehospital.com",
  "phone": "+2348012345678",
  "registrationNumber": "MCGH-2026-001",
  "timezone": "Africa/Lagos",
  "currency": "NGN"
}

### Test API health
GET http://localhost:3001/api/health
